# The Four Musketeers (Bastok 3-1, mission.bastok.the_four_musketeers). A level 30 Warrior of Bastok in Metalworks, 1-1
# to 2-3 completed by a GM (none current; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Section 1: Malduc's own script
# plays the gate guards' mission list 1001; its finish with option 0 does nothing, with option 10 begins the mission and
# says YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION. Section 2: Malduc 1002. Status 0: Ayame and Naji answer their own defaults 701 and 700;
# Iron Eater 715, whose finish with option 1 does nothing; 715 again, whose finish with option 0 sets status 1. Status
# 1: Iron Eater 716, Ayame 718, Naji 717.
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Ayame/onTrigger Metalworks/Iron_Eater/onTrigger Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/715 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001 Beadeaux/Copper_Quadav/onMobDeath Beadeaux/onZoneIn/1 Beadeaux/onEventFinish/120 PashhowMarshlands/onZoneIn/1 PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/10 PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/11
char zone=Metalworks pos=66,-15,4 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
login
trigger Malduc                          # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 10: nothing
trigger Malduc
finish option=10                        # begun
trigger Malduc                          # 1002
finish-if-event
trigger Ayame                           # status 0: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger Naji
finish-if-event
trigger Iron_Eater                      # 715
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Iron_Eater                      # 715
finish option=0                         # status 1
trigger Iron_Eater                      # 716
finish-if-event
trigger Ayame                           # 718
finish-if-event
trigger Naji                            # 717
finish-if-event
